5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. I am Benjamin. Let us proceed with logic and care.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Welcome, young ones. Wisdom comes from listening to all voices.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi there! I'm May. Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I won't back down from this.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I feel a bit nervous. Who should we trust first?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Trust is earned through consistency. Let's observe their words.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Patience is key. The wolf hides in plain sight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,I agree with Benjamin. Let's keep our eyes open.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll watch everyone. No one gets past me.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,That sounds good. I will try to stay calm.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Calmness is a virtue. Let's not jump to conclusions.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. Haste makes waste. Let us think deeply.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,I'm just here to enjoy the game. Let's see who blinks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready. Let's start the investigation.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I will listen to everyone's opinions.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Good. Let's end the day and see what the night brings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,A good start. May the best logic prevail.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,See you all tomorrow. Goodnight!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
